eboat.com/blog/2026/11/the-brains-fear-center-moonlights-as-the-save-button-for-memories</link><description>杏仁核中的神经元&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 16:41:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/the-brains-fear-center-moonlights-as-the-save-button-for-memories</guid></item><item><title>量子气体显微镜一次性解析单个原子的“颜色”</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/quantum-gas-microscope-resolves-the-color-of-individual-atoms-in-a-single-shot</link><description>现在，由 ICREA 教授 Leticia Tarruell 领导的 Carlos Gas-Ferrer、Antonio Rubio-Abadal 博士、Sandra Buob 博士、Leonardo Bezzo 和 Jonatan Höschele 博士已使用他们的设备对锶 87 进行成像。该费米子具有 10 种不同的自旋状态，产生彩色图片，其中可以区分每个单独的状态。 &lt;img src="https://www.icfo.eu/news/2328/quione-announcing-the-birth-of-a-unique-analog-quantum-processor-in-the-world/" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 16:26:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/quantum-gas-microscope-resolves-the-color-of-individual-atoms-in-a-single-shot</guid></item><item><title>大脑植入物如何将思想转化为言语</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/how-brain-implants-turn-thoughts-into-speech</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 16:11:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/how-brain-implants-turn-thoughts-into-speech</guid></item><item><title>前专员 Ann Cavoukian 博士：永远不要放弃隐私！</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/former-commissioner-dr-ann-cavoukian-never-give-up-on-privacy</link><description>2020 年 3 月，即安大略省宣布进入紧急状态的那一周，我发表了与 Ann Cavoukian 博士的对话，内容涉及流行病 #surveillance 以及我们会被要求以安全的名义放弃什么。&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 15:56:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/former-commissioner-dr-ann-cavoukian-never-give-up-on-privacy</guid></item><item><title>令人震惊的网络威胁：代理多态恶意软件可能已经存在</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/an-alarming-cyber-threat-agentic-polymorphic-malware-may-already-be-here</link><description>人工智能可以进一步增强这些能力。考虑一个具有人工智能功能的恶意代理，它不仅仅能够执行一组指令。它可以评估它面临的防御，改变它的行为，改变它的执行方式，选择不同的攻击策略，并在受感染的网络中遵循不同的路线。它可以检测最近发现的漏洞，更改代码属性以避免基于签名的检测，并将恶意活动伪装成授权的管理任务。&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 15:41:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/an-alarming-cyber-threat-agentic-polymorphic-malware-may-already-be-here</guid></item><item><title>化学如何成为生物学的演变故事</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/the-evolving-story-of-how-chemistry-became-biology</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 15:26:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/the-evolving-story-of-how-chemistry-became-biology</guid></item><item><title>什么是生命起源的新陈代谢第一理论？</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/what-is-the-metabolism-first-theory-for-the-origin-of-life</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 15:11:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/what-is-the-metabolism-first-theory-for-the-origin-of-life</guid></item></channel></rss>